    {"id": 4, "claim": "The date of ~65,000 years ago is closest to the option 'soon after 60,000 years ago'.", "evidence": "65,000 is 5,000 years after 60,000. In geological timescales, 5,000 years is considered 'soon'. Option A (80k) is 15k years off. Option C (40k) is 25k years off. Option D (20k) is 45k years off.", "weight": 0.9, "depends_on": [2, 3]},
